        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 29 at 5:45PM MDT until July 29 at 6:00PM MDT by NWS Riverton WY</headline>
        <description>At 545 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was 15 miles northwest of
Casper moving east at 25 mph.

HAZARD...Half dollar sized hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

Locations impacted include...
Goldeneye Reservoir.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
