        <senderName>NWS Wilmington OH</senderName>
        <headline>Heat Advisory issued July 29 at 7:48PM EDT until July 30 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Wilmington OH</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Heat index values up to 103.

* WHERE...Portions of southeast Indiana, northeast and northern
Kentucky, and south central and southwest Ohio.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Wednesday.

* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures and high humidity may cause heat
illnesses.
</description>
        <instruction>Drink plenty of fluids, stay in air-conditioned rooms, stay out of
the sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.

Take extra precautions when outside. Wear lightweight and loose
fitting clothing. Try to limit strenuous activities to early morning
or evening. Take action when you see symptoms of heat exhaustion and
heat stroke.</instruction>
