        <senderName>NWS Fairbanks AK</senderName>
        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued July 29 at 3:48PM AKDT until July 30 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK</headline>
        <description>Arctic Alaska Coastal Waters out 100 NM

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent the average of the highest one-
third of the combined wind-wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...S winds 20 kt becoming W. Seas 4 ft.
.WED...W winds 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.WED NIGHT...W winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.THU...SW winds 10 kt. Seas 2 ft.
.THU NIGHT...SE winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.FRI...W winds 10 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...SW winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.SAT...SW winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.SUN...E winds 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
</description>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
