        <senderName>NWS Sioux Falls SD</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 29 at 6:52PM CDT until July 29 at 7:30PM CDT by NWS Sioux Falls SD</headline>
        <description>At 651 PM CDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from near Mitchell to 7 miles northeast of Lynch, moving
east at 35 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...at 6:46 pm CDT the Mitchell ASOS reported a wind gusts of
63 mph.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

These severe storms will be near...
Mitchell, Ethan, Delmont, Dimock, and Dante around 655 PM CDT.
Parkston around 700 PM CDT.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
