        <senderName>NWS Albany NY</senderName>
        <headline>Heat Advisory issued July 29 at 7:53PM EDT until July 29 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Heat index values between 95 and 100 expected Wednesday.

* WHERE...Portions of northwestern Connecticut and east central and
eastern New York.

* WHEN...From noon to 8 PM EDT Wednesday.

* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures and high humidity may cause heat
illnesses.
</description>
        <instruction>Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of
the sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.</instruction>
