        <headline>Heat Advisory issued July 29 at 7:53PM EDT until July 29 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>Heat index values will drop below 95 this evening as temperatures
cool with the sun set. Therefore, the heat advisory will be allowed
to expire.
</description>
