        <senderName>NWS Sioux Falls SD</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 29 at 6:56PM CDT until July 29 at 7:30PM CDT by NWS Sioux Falls SD</headline>
        <description>At 655 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Letcher, or 9
miles north of Mitchell, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Trained weather spotters reported seeing rotation and a
brief funnel 6 miles southeast of Fedora at 6:50 pm CDT.

IMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to
roofs, siding, and trees.

This severe storm will be near...
Mitchell around 700 PM CDT.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
