        <description>THE NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE HAS ISSUED SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH
558 IN EFFECT UNTIL MIDNIGHT MDT TONIGHT FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS

IN SOUTH DAKOTA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 6 COUNTIES

IN NORTHWEST SOUTH DAKOTA

BUTTE

IN SOUTHWEST SOUTH DAKOTA

CUSTER                FALL RIVER

IN WEST CENTRAL SOUTH DAKOTA

LAWRENCE              MEADE                 PENNINGTON

IN WYOMING THIS WATCH INCLUDES 3 COUNTIES

IN NORTHEAST WYOMING

CAMPBELL              CROOK                 WESTON

THIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF BUCKHORN, CLARETON, CUSTER, DEADWOOD,
DOWNTOWN BELLE FOURCHE, DOWNTOWN NEWCASTLE, EDGEMONT, FAITH,
FOUR CORNERS, GILLETTE, HERMOSA, HILL CITY, HOT SPRINGS, LEAD,
MOORCROFT, MORRISEY, RAPID CITY, ROCHELLE, SPEARFISH, STURGIS,
SUNDANCE, UNION CENTER, UPTON, WALL, AND WRIGHT.
</description>
