Carnegie, Martins Crossroads, Moye, Aycock Mill, Randolph Co
A/p, Dickey, Coles, Cordrays Mill, Peterson Hill, Coleman,
Springvale Station and Clarks Mill.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood
</description>
