        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Watch issued July 29 at 6:14PM MDT until July 29 at 9:00PM MDT by NWS Riverton WY</headline>
        <description>SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH 556 REMAINS VALID UNTIL 9 PM MDT THIS
EVENING FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS

IN WYOMING THIS WATCH INCLUDES 6 COUNTIES

IN CENTRAL WYOMING

FREMONT               HOT SPRINGS           NATRONA

IN NORTH CENTRAL WYOMING

BIG HORN              JOHNSON               WASHAKIE

THIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF BASIN, BUFFALO, CASPER, DUBOIS,
GREYBULL, KAYCEE, LANDER, LOVELL, RIVERTON, SHELL, THERMOPOLIS,
AND WORLAND.
</description>
