            <value>WXR</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>VTEC</valueName>
            <value>/O.NEW.PAAQ.TS.W.0016.250730T0019Z-000000T0000Z/</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>WEAHandling</valueName>
            <value>Imminent Threat</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>CMAMtext</valueName>
            <value>NWS: TSUNAMI danger on the coast. Move to high ground or inland now.</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>CMAMlongtext</valueName>
            <value>The National Weather Service has issued a TSUNAMI WARNING. A series of powerful waves and strong currents may impact coasts near you. You are in danger. Get away from coastal waters. Move to high ground or inland now. Keep away from the coast until local officials say it is safe to return.</value>
        </parameter>
        <area>
