        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 29 at 8:27PM EDT until July 29 at 9:00PM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>SVRMLB

The National Weather Service in Melbourne has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
West central Lake County in east central Florida...

* Until 900 PM EDT.

* At 826 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Lady Lake,
moving north at 5 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

* Locations impacted include...
Lady Lake, Lake Griffin, Emeralda, The Villages, and Lisbon.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
