Skunk River at Augusta affecting Lee, Henry IA and Des Moines
Counties.

* WHAT...Flooding is possible.

* WHERE...Skunk River at Augusta.

* WHEN...From Thursday morning to Sunday afternoon.

* IMPACTS...At 19.0 feet, Water affects driveways and gravel access
roads in Augusta.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 6:45 PM CDT Tuesday the stage was 11.1 feet.
- Forecast...Flood stage may be reached late Thursday morning.
- Flood stage is 15.0 feet.
</description>
        <instruction>

