        <description>SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH 557 REMAINS VALID UNTIL 10 PM CDT THIS
EVENING FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS

IN SOUTH DAKOTA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 13 COUNTIES

IN SOUTH CENTRAL SOUTH DAKOTA

AURORA                BRULE                 CHARLES MIX
DOUGLAS               GREGORY

IN SOUTHEAST SOUTH DAKOTA

BON HOMME             CLAY                  DAVISON
HANSON                HUTCHINSON            MCCOOK
TURNER                YANKTON

THIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF ALEXANDRIA, ARMOUR, AVON,
BRIDGEWATER, BURKE, CANISTOTA, CENTERVILLE, CHAMBERLAIN,
CHANCELLOR, CLAYTON, CORSICA, DELMONT, EMERY, FREEMAN, GREGORY,
