        <senderName>NWS Riverton WY</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 29 at 6:38PM MDT until July 29 at 7:15PM MDT by NWS Riverton WY</headline>
        <description>SVRRIW

The National Weather Service in Riverton has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
West central Natrona County in central Wyoming...

* Until 715 PM MDT.

* At 638 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Lost Cabin,
which is 28 miles east of Shoshoni, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

* This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
west central Natrona County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
