        <description>At 816 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Sandusky,
moving southeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to trees and power lines.

Locations impacted include...
Sandusky, Marblehead, Bay View, Sandusky South, and Fairview Lanes.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
