        <description>SVRSGF

The National Weather Service in Springfield has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Northwestern Stone County in southwestern Missouri...
Northeastern Barry County in southwestern Missouri...
Southeastern Lawrence County in southwestern Missouri...

* Until 800 PM CDT.

* At 722 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Verona, or
near Aurora, moving east at 10 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

* Locations impacted include...
Monett, Aurora, Marionville, Crane, Verona, and Pleasant Ridge.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.

Torrential rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to
flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction>
