        <senderName>NWS Cleveland OH</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued July 30 at 8:27PM EDT until July 30 at 8:30PM EDT by NWS Cleveland OH</headline>
        <description>The storm which prompted the warning has weakened below severe
limits, and no longer poses an immediate threat to life or property.
Therefore, the warning will be allowed to expire.  However, gusty
winds and heavy rain are still possible with this thunderstorm.

To report severe weather, contact your nearest law enforcement
agency. They will relay your report to the National Weather Service
Cleveland.
</description>
