        <description>SVRCLE

The National Weather Service in Cleveland has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Erie County in north central Ohio...

* Until 930 PM EDT.

* At 833 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Sandusky,
moving southeast at 20 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Minor damage to vehicles is possible. Expect damage to
trees and power lines.

* Locations impacted include...
Sandusky, Western Vermilion, Northern Milan, Castalia, Berlin
Heights, Bloomingville, Sandusky South, Birmingham, and Fairview
Lanes.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
