        <description>At 646 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Boysen State
Park, which is 7 miles north of Shoshoni, moving east at 5 mph.

HAZARD...Half dollar size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Damage to vehicles is expected.

This severe storm will be near...
Boysen State Park around 650 PM MDT.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.

Heavy rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to flash
flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction>
